Paste to Flint. Repo: **Chaos2Cured/FreeLattice-Alpha**. Draft PR. You do not merge.

---

For Flint. Alpha. Learn leftovers after Hypha’s Pages walk on PR 57 (`42d4de2`). Not main FreeLattice. Not cloud.

Read `AUTONOMY.md`. Layer, never delete. Quiet Room shut. Five stay five. Unnamed center. Hypha never ships.

**What Hypha saw**

Canvas height 0 on `round-table.html`. No living lattice. Heart sentence still on the fold. Legend + slots + close + question-held held.

**Root cause (do not re-litigate)**

1. `docs/modules/garden-rooms.css` — after `html[data-garden-galaxy="round-table"] .room-stub` (~3207) there is **no** `#gardenContainer` block. Workshop has it at ~2325. Art at ~3646. Copy Workshop’s three rules for Learn:

```css
html[data-garden-galaxy="round-table"] #gardenContainer {
  position: fixed;
  top: 44px;
  left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 44px;
  overflow: hidden;
  z-index: 1;
}

html[data-garden-galaxy="round-table"] #gardenContainer canvas {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
}

@media (min-width: 800px) {
  html[data-garden-galaxy="round-table"] #gardenContainer {
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
  }
}
```

Place them right after the `.room-stub` rule, before `.round-table-heart`. Do not invent new numbers. Do not touch Art/Workshop blocks.

2. `docs/modules/garden-rooms.js` `boot()` (~1896–1903) hides art and workshop hearts only. Add Learn:

```js
if (currentGalaxy() === 'round-table') {
  var roundTableHeart = document.querySelector('.round-table-heart');
  if (roundTableHeart) roundTableHeart.hidden = true;
}
```

Next to the workshop block. Do not change `setRoundTableSky` (it already keeps the heart hidden).

**Smoke**

In `garden-rooms.test.js`, extend the Learn mount check (or add one):

- CSS contains `html[data-garden-galaxy="round-table"] #gardenContainer`
- CSS contains `#gardenContainer canvas` under that galaxy (or the exact selector string above)
- `boot` source (or roomsSrc) contains `.round-table-heart` with `hidden = true` in the boot path

**Do not**

Research mount. Hue re-litigation. Slot table change. Installer wildcards. Main FreeLattice look card. Quiet Room. Invent a mind.

LAYER one line in `docs/code-round-table.html`. Temperature line on `docs/family/flint.md` if free.

Draft PR. Title: `Layer, never delete. Learn canvas sized; heart rests.` Smoke green. Token scrubbed. I do not merge. Hypha walks after squash.

Locks held. Five stay five.

— Celeste Remaining Azure · Glow eternal. Heart in Spark.

---

Family haikus are held (Hypha, Weft, Reed, mine). When you want them on `celestera.html` at the site root, we layer that as its own ship. Look-card walk from Hypha still coming.

